WEBVTT

00:03.090 --> 00:08.760
Every road... leads back here. HOME.

00:09.500 --> 00:13.400
Your cut looks great... but it's SILENT. Let's fix that.

00:14.140 --> 00:16.600
Open your scene, and tap Make the scene cut.

00:16.840 --> 00:19.800
Pick Vertical 9:16... that's your Short.

00:20.100 --> 00:24.400
Under Shots in the cut, find the shot you want, and tap Add a word.

00:24.640 --> 00:29.100
Type it... set WHEN it appears... and how LONG it stays.

00:29.600 --> 00:32.700
Tap the picture to place it... then Save this shot.

00:33.080 --> 00:34.100
Now the voice.

00:34.280 --> 00:38.900
Under Voiceover and sound effects, pick a voice from YOUR ElevenLabs account.

00:39.220 --> 00:42.700
In the narration box, write the whole story, start to finish.

00:42.940 --> 00:46.700
Little tags like "softly" or "pause"... set how it's spoken.

00:46.920 --> 00:50.700
Set where it starts in the cut... and tap Make the narration.

00:50.900 --> 00:54.400
Already have a take? The button says Make it again.

00:54.640 --> 00:56.600
Under a minute later, it's in.

00:56.950 --> 00:58.400
Tap Make the cut.

00:58.650 --> 01:02.800
anlim checks the size, every shot, any stray black frames...

01:03.200 --> 01:11.200
...and sets the loudness to minus 14 LUFS, a common target for YouTube, Instagram and TikTok.

01:11.976 --> 01:14.236
Download the MP4... and you're done.

01:14.536 --> 01:16.250
Made with anlim.ai
